Package: powerdevil
Version: @DEB_POWERDEVIL_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: KDE
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://invent.kde.org/plasma/powerdevil
Depends: qt6-base, qt6-declarative, plasma-activities, plasma-workspace, libkscreen, layer-shell-qt, kf6-auth, kf6-config, kf6-coreaddons, kf6-crash, kf6-dbusaddons, kf6-globalaccel, kf6-i18n, kf6-idletime, kf6-itemmodels, kf6-kcmutils, kf6-kio, kf6-kirigami, kf6-notifications, kf6-service, kf6-solid, kf6-windowsystem, kf6-xmlgui
Description: KDE Plasma power management daemon for Xios
 PowerDevil provides the org.kde.Solid.PowerManagement service, its bundled action
 plugins, the power profile OSD, and the power management System Settings module.
 Battery and AC state come from org.freedesktop.UPower, which xios-hwbridged
 provides on-device. The Linux udev backlight backend and the XCB/DPMS fade helper
 are not built; screen brightness goes through KWin's brightness interface. Suspend
 and hibernate need org.freedesktop.login1 and are inert on this platform.
